{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-91","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-91"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-talk-403816010-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-91","missionId":"event-rogue-91","mission":"점괘","scene":"점괘","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 어두운 텐트 안에 앉아 있다. 귓가에 들리는 디스포 야시장의 소음, 잠에 빠져들게 하는 향기, 너무 낮은 별의 중력 때문에 불안한 기분이 든다","talkId":403816010,"textHash":"16474974022327433432","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:91/talk-403816010","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"267082f7b68f785c","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-talk-403816011-line"],"bwikiPage":"占卜","bwikiRevision":58180,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12925","bwikiMission":"점괘"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-talk-403816011-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-91","missionId":"event-rogue-91","mission":"점괘","scene":"점괘","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"베일에 표정을 가린 점술가가 흐릿한 눈으로 당신을 바라본다. 그녀는 별하늘처럼 깊은 긴 소매 속에서 타워트 카드를 꺼내 능숙하게 몇 묶음으로 나눠 당신 앞에 늘어놓는다","talkId":403816011,"textHash":"17507718578104008724","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:91/talk-403816011","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"267082f7b68f785c","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-talk-403816012-line"],"bwikiPage":"占卜","bwikiRevision":58180,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12925","bwikiMission":"점괘"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-talk-403816012-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-91","missionId":"event-rogue-91","mission":"점괘","scene":"점괘","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「운명을 엿본다는 건 블록의 밑을 빼는 것과 같습니다. 너무 욕심을 부린다면, 예지는 와르르 무너질 겁니다」 점술가가 카드 더미에 손을 얹는다. 「당신은 무엇을 보고 싶나요?」","talkId":403816012,"textHash":"9497239936211059594","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:91/talk-403816012","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"267082f7b68f785c","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"占卜","bwikiRevision":58180,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12925","bwikiMission":"점괘"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-15336763564258686827-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-91","missionId":"event-rogue-91","mission":"점괘","scene":"점괘","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"곧 부자가 될 수 있을까?","talkId":null,"textHash":"15336763564258686827","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:91/text-15336763564258686827","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"09f85c0ccbf859d7","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-8923900433064796892-effect"],"bwikiPage":"占卜","bwikiRevision":58180,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12925","bwikiMission":"점괘"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-8923900433064796892-effect","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-91","missionId":"event-rogue-91","mission":"점괘","scene":"점괘","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"획득하는 기물의 효과는 우주 조각과 관련이 있다","talkId":null,"textHash":"8923900433064796892","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:91/text-8923900433064796892","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"09f85c0ccbf859d7","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"占卜","bwikiRevision":58180,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12925","bwikiMission":"점괘","bwikiReplyToIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-15336763564258686827-choice"]},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-6474885181903790982-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-91","missionId":"event-rogue-91","mission":"점괘","scene":"점괘","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"최근 위험한 일이 있을까?","talkId":null,"textHash":"6474885181903790982","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:91/text-6474885181903790982","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"7d40aa9fab133675","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-4303351408423177309-effect"],"bwikiPage":"占卜","bwikiRevision":58180,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12925","bwikiMission":"점괘"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-4303351408423177309-effect","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-91","missionId":"event-rogue-91","mission":"점괘","scene":"점괘","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"획득하는 기물의 효과는 전투와 관련이 있다","talkId":null,"textHash":"4303351408423177309","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:91/text-4303351408423177309","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"7d40aa9fab133675","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"占卜","bwikiRevision":58180,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12925","bwikiMission":"점괘","bwikiReplyToIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-6474885181903790982-choice"]},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-5361285451622126779-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-91","missionId":"event-rogue-91","mission":"점괘","scene":"점괘","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"여정이 순조로울까?","talkId":null,"textHash":"5361285451622126779","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:91/text-5361285451622126779","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"4e62d008e2942311","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-18042534437605494861-effect"],"bwikiPage":"占卜","bwikiRevision":58180,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12925","bwikiMission":"점괘"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-18042534437605494861-effect","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-91","missionId":"event-rogue-91","mission":"점괘","scene":"점괘","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"획득하는 기물의 효과는 파츠와 관련이 있다","talkId":null,"textHash":"18042534437605494861","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:91/text-18042534437605494861","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"4e62d008e2942311","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"占卜","bwikiRevision":58180,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12925","bwikiMission":"점괘","bwikiReplyToIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-5361285451622126779-choice"]},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-talk-403816014-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-91","missionId":"event-rogue-91","mission":"점괘","scene":"점괘","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"피폐한 지금의 상황은 당신이 원하던 모습이 아니다. 당신은 생각이 너무 많아서 종종 눈앞의 기회를 놓치고, 그로 인해 회한에 빠진다","talkId":403816014,"textHash":"10229426797575582197","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:91/talk-403816014","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"429d3017607aaf05","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"占卜","bwikiRevision":58180,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12925","bwikiMission":"점괘"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-talk-403816016-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-91","missionId":"event-rogue-91","mission":"점괘","scene":"점괘","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「운이 안 좋네요. 이 호신 부적을 받으세요. 그게 당신을 지켜줄 겁니다」 점술가가 긴 한숨을 내쉬며 당신의 손바닥에 따스한 마음이 담긴 부적을 올려둔다","talkId":403816016,"textHash":"14709882173059915974","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:91/talk-403816016","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"3db1c07deaa18269","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"占卜","bwikiRevision":58180,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12925","bwikiMission":"점괘"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-4143492973205421997-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-91","missionId":"event-rogue-91","mission":"점괘","scene":"점괘","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"호신 부적을 받는다","talkId":null,"textHash":"4143492973205421997","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:91/text-4143492973205421997","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"c83017b0498f9931","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"占卜","bwikiRevision":58180,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12925","bwikiMission":"점괘"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-talk-403816017-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-91","missionId":"event-rogue-91","mission":"점괘","scene":"점괘","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"적극적인 태도는 긍정적인 결과를 낳는다. 노력 끝에 당신의 인생은 곧 흥미진진한 전환점을 맞이하게 될 것이다","talkId":403816017,"textHash":"9273263589644337092","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:91/talk-403816017","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"01c327a9bb33be33","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"占卜","bwikiRevision":58180,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12925","bwikiMission":"점괘"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-talk-403816010-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-talk-403816011-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-talk-403816012-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-15336763564258686827-choice","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-8923900433064796892-effect","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-6474885181903790982-choice","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-4303351408423177309-effect","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-5361285451622126779-choice","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-18042534437605494861-effect","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-talk-403816014-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-talk-403816016-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-text-4143492973205421997-choice","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-91-talk-403816017-line"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":13,"reviewRows":0,"segments":8,"reorderedRows":0},"retainedTextRowIds":[]}